WEBVTT

00:00:13.047 --> 00:00:18.647
Until the river's
finally crossed

00:00:18.767 --> 00:00:25.247
You'll never feel
the solid ground

00:00:26.007 --> 00:00:31.287
You have to get a little lost

00:00:31.567 --> 00:00:34.007
On your way

00:00:34.567 --> 00:00:37.807
To being found

00:00:40.887 --> 00:00:43.927
Where the Northwind

00:00:44.127 --> 00:00:46.927
Meets the sea

00:00:47.287 --> 00:00:49.807
There's a mother

00:00:50.407 --> 00:00:53.207
Full of memory

00:00:53.487 --> 00:00:57.687
Come, my darling,
homeward bound

00:00:58.127 --> 00:01:01.527
Where all is lost

00:01:03.007 --> 00:01:05.327
Then all is found

00:01:06.207 --> 00:01:09.047
All is found

00:01:09.527 --> 00:01:12.767
All is found

00:01:19.807 --> 00:01:21.807
(LOST IN THE WOODS PLAYING)

00:01:31.807 --> 00:01:33.927
Again you're gone

00:01:35.247 --> 00:01:38.447
Off on a diff'rent path
than mine

00:01:38.527 --> 00:01:40.127
I'm left behind

00:01:40.207 --> 00:01:44.367
Wondering if I should follow

00:01:45.007 --> 00:01:46.927
You had to go

00:01:49.047 --> 00:01:52.287
And, of course,
it's always fine

00:01:52.567 --> 00:01:57.807
I prob'ly could catch up
with you tomorrow

00:01:59.007 --> 00:02:05.447
But is this what it feels like
to be growing apart?

00:02:05.527 --> 00:02:07.847
When did I become the one

00:02:07.927 --> 00:02:11.927
Who's always
chasing your heart?

00:02:12.087 --> 00:02:14.927
Now I turn around
and find

00:02:15.047 --> 00:02:18.167
I am lost in the woods

00:02:18.247 --> 00:02:21.247
North is South
Right is left

00:02:21.447 --> 00:02:24.607
When you're gone

00:02:24.687 --> 00:02:27.487
I'm the one who sees you home

00:02:27.567 --> 00:02:31.487
But now I'm lost in the woods

00:02:31.567 --> 00:02:36.647
And I don't know
what path you are on

00:02:37.487 --> 00:02:39.327
I'm lost in the woods

00:02:43.807 --> 00:02:45.647
Up till now

00:02:45.847 --> 00:02:50.127
The next step
was a question of how

00:02:50.487 --> 00:02:55.767
I never thought it was
a question of whether

00:02:56.607 --> 00:02:58.647
Who am I

00:03:00.247 --> 00:03:02.887
If I'm not your guy?

00:03:03.207 --> 00:03:08.367
Where am I
if we're not together?

00:03:08.967 --> 00:03:11.727
Forever

00:03:12.047 --> 00:03:14.727
Now I know
you're my true North

00:03:14.807 --> 00:03:18.207
'Cause I am lost in the woods

00:03:18.327 --> 00:03:21.167
Up is down
Day is night

00:03:21.247 --> 00:03:24.647
When you're not there

00:03:24.767 --> 00:03:27.967
Oh, you're my only landmark

00:03:28.047 --> 00:03:31.367
So I'm lost in the woods

00:03:31.887 --> 00:03:36.247
Wondering if you still care

00:03:37.127 --> 00:03:39.487
But I'll wait

00:03:40.727 --> 00:03:42.767
For a sign

00:03:42.847 --> 00:03:46.767
-For a sign
-That I'm your path

00:03:46.847 --> 00:03:50.487
-'Cause you are mine
-You are mine

00:03:50.567 --> 00:03:52.247
Until then

00:03:52.367 --> 00:03:56.407
-I'm lost in the woods
-Lost in the woods

00:03:56.487 --> 00:03:59.207
In the woods
Lost in the woods

00:03:59.287 --> 00:04:00.967
I'm lost in the woods

00:04:01.047 --> 00:04:05.007
Lost in the woods
I'm lost

00:04:05.087 --> 00:04:10.087
I'm lost in the woods

00:04:22.647 --> 00:04:25.047
(GENTLE ORCHESTRAL MUSIC
PLAYING)

00:05:58.527 --> 00:06:00.487
(OLAF VOCALIZES)

00:06:00.567 --> 00:06:03.167
(AS ELSA)
Show yourself right now!

00:06:03.327 --> 00:06:04.807
(AS IDUNA)
Elsa, be who you are.

00:06:04.967 --> 00:06:06.687
(AS ELSA)
Oh, I will, Mama, I will.

00:06:06.767 --> 00:06:07.767
(IN NORMAL VOICE) Elsa's dead.

00:06:07.967 --> 00:06:09.167
Olaf's dead.

00:06:09.767 --> 00:06:11.047
Anna cries.

00:06:11.207 --> 00:06:13.087
And then a bunch of important
things happen that I forgot.

00:06:13.247 --> 00:06:14.247
But all that matters is,
I was right.

00:06:14.327 --> 00:06:16.087
And water has memory,
and thus...

00:06:16.167 --> 00:06:18.087
(GASPS) I live!

00:06:18.327 --> 00:06:19.607
And so do you.

00:06:21.167 --> 00:06:22.487
Whoa!

00:06:22.567 --> 00:06:24.167
We live!

00:06:24.367 --> 00:06:26.967
-We live! Oh!
-(SNOWMEN CHITTERING)

00:06:27.047 --> 00:06:29.567
(LAUGHS) Good story.

